==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features [[Mega]] {{p|Charizard}} Y.
*This card's immersive illustration features {{p|Charmander}}, {{p|Charmeleon}}, {{p|Charizard}}, and Mega Charizard Y.
*'''Crimson Dive''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|M Charizard-EX|13}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{LGPE}}.

